- > Libdbase v0.4 < -

By Alvaro Cortés. accsc@arbornet.org. 

LibDollyBase is a library used by DollyBase.  
Its alpha version, not as stable as a normal release.

To use the library compile it and later include the file libdbase.h in your app.

To compile your app don't forget to mention to gcc that add the .a file.

Ex:
	gcc  foo.c -o foo -I ../blabla libdollybase_0.4_s.a


You can use all the functions. To use a database, the structure DATABASEDBF is basic. 

More functions will be implemented.

